# HOOPLA: the goals and the save. Winning a tournament on standard hoops is
# the gold goal and makes that fighter a champion (kept in the save, with
# the fewest rematches); champions as four different fighters is the
# cherry. On other hoop rules nothing counts. The goals come back from the
# save.
seed 25
game hoopla
wait 30
expect goals == 0
cheat towin 7
cheat tourney 0 0
wait 25
press A
waituntil state == 6 200
cheat winmatch
wait 2
wait 25
press A
waituntil state == 6 200
